      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'On this vessel, no one remains in the same place for long.

    The roles
    of deckhand and captain will shift as the journey continues.

    

    When
    the change comes, you must adapt quickly.

    The boat does not wait for hesitation.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
